WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.830
- So wait, we both grew
up during the '80s,

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:03.630
so what were your favorite
parts of the decade?

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:05.120
Did you love the music?

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:06.650
- Man, I loved the music, man.

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:10.130
We used to have a show
that came on Friday night

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:13.560
in Indiana called "Night Trax"
and they played all '80s.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:14.460
- [Kelly] With an X?

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:16.080
- A "Night Trax"
- [Kelly] Trax, with an X?

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.213
- Yeah, with the X.
- [Kelly] They were cool.

00:00:18.213 --> 00:00:21.920
- Yeah, yeah and man, they
played Bruce Springsteen.

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:26.670
- They played...What's her name?

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.180
Grace Jones.
- [Kelly] Yeah!

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:30.970
- Yeah, I got introduced to
a lot of music from the '80s

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:32.510
that, you know, it's like-
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:34.339
- '80s music was the best.

00:00:34.339 --> 00:00:35.172
- I feel like too,

00:00:35.172 --> 00:00:37.150
like radio was more broad.

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:38.870
Like you could hear like
so many different kinds

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:40.300
of artists on one station.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:41.920
- [Mike] Yeah.
- Yeah, I like that.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:43.550
- British music.
- [Kelly] I love...What?

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:45.413
- That's why people like
lot of my black friends

00:00:45.413 --> 00:00:48.337
they like, man, how you
know all this white music?

00:00:48.337 --> 00:00:49.299
- "Night Trax"

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:50.132
(Kelly and audience laughs)

00:00:50.132 --> 00:00:51.710
- "Night Trax"
- "Night Trax" with an X.

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:53.395
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.
- They knew what was up.

00:00:53.395 --> 00:00:55.940
♪ It's the Rhinestone Cowboy ♪

00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:57.384
Yeah exactly.

00:00:57.384 --> 00:00:58.518
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:58.518 --> 00:00:59.351
♪ I was living on a ♪

00:00:59.351 --> 00:01:00.259
See, you just need-

00:01:00.259 --> 00:01:01.130
- They didn't know I knew that.

00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:02.450
- I know, but you know that,

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:03.920
and Grace Jones and Bruce Springsteen

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:05.200
they're all on the same chain.

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:06.033
That's amazing.

00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:07.200
- And, I know Pooh Shiesty.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.149
Do you ever heard of Pooh Shiesty?

00:01:08.149 --> 00:01:09.253
- No, Pooh Shiesty?

00:01:09.253 --> 00:01:10.959
(Mike laughs)

00:01:10.959 --> 00:01:12.430
That sounds like something else.

00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:13.884
- It's a rapper, it's a rapper.

00:01:13.884 --> 00:01:14.717
(Mike laughs)

00:01:14.717 --> 00:01:15.570
- Sounds like something else.

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:17.700
Maybe, it's a different
name where you grow up.

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:18.637
I don't know.

00:01:18.637 --> 00:01:19.630
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:19.630 --> 00:01:21.903
It's a family show,
sorry, I took it there.

